        <h3 class="subhead2" id="isPasted" aria-level="2" role="heading"><strong>2026 District Court Jury Trial Schedule</strong></h3><p>The District Courts have released the 2026 Jury Trial Schedule. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>For specific dates and court requirements, click on the appropriate link below:</p><table style="width: 100%; margin-left: calc(0%);"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 50.0000%;"><ul><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/455/26th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">26th District Court</a></li><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/487/368th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">368th District Court</a></li><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/517/425th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">425th District Court</a></li><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/1821/512th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">512th District Court</a></li></ul></td><td style="width: 50.0000%;"><ul><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/466/277th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">277th District Court</a></li><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/500/395th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">395th District Court</a></li><li><a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/537/480th-District-Court" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">480th District Court</a></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>

