	<div class="row nest last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last id45a425c1-1266-44fb-94bc-a0509cb4b8ed" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="45a425c1-1266-44fb-94bc-a0509cb4b8ed">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditorcac8c525-bde5-43fd-a7e8-5ae8eaa9fd0a" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h3 aria-level="2" id="isPasted">Standing Orders</h3><p>The District Courts have released several standing orders related to criminal matters. &nbsp;Counsel should review and be familiar with these orders, which may be found at links below. &nbsp;</p><ol><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/12486" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Standing Order Regarding Appellate Briefs</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/12485" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Standing Order Regarding Experts and Investigators</a></li><li><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/13481" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Standing Order Regarding Trial Continuances</a></li></ol>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + 'cac8c525-bde5-43fd-a7e8-5ae8eaa9fd0a'));
	});
</script>
</div>

