<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditore33f5504-1ee7-426f-844b-2df3db3872d0" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>The Justice Center is open to the public Monday-Friday from 8:00 AM-5:00 PM. Members of the public are required to enter at the corner of 4th and Martin Luther King St.</p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
