						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_2" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_2" role="button" aria-controls="tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_2" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="2" data-tabname="Security" contenteditable="false">Security</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_2" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditoreaa061c8-41e7-485b-ac94-7e71a7f5af87" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>In order to enter the Justice Center, you are required to go through security screening. &nbsp;In addition, any bags/packages you bring with you are subject to search.</p><p>The Williamson County Sheriff&apos;s Office is responsible for security of the Justice Center.</p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + 'eaa061c8-41e7-485b-ac94-7e71a7f5af87'));
	});
</script>
</div>

				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_3" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_3" role="button" aria-controls="tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_3" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="3" data-tabname="Parking" contenteditable="false">Parking</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_3" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn6b77653a-312c-4b71-b654-3e3eac8532e2_3" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor8937b9b5-a38f-4a9d-8d9f-8a586e5d4bb4" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>There are several free parking options around the Justice Center. &nbsp;The surface lot on 4th St., just north of the building and the parking garage on 4th St., across from the Williamson County Jail are the nearest to the public entrance to the building.</p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
