						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_0" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_0" role="button" aria-controls="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_0" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="0" data-tabname="Find Court dates and Case information" contenteditable="false">Find Court dates and Case information</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_0" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_0" >




<div data-widget-id="69134710-d533-4503-930a-e4812a106c24" data-moduleName="list" id="widgetText69134710-d533-4503-930a-e4812a106c24" class="widget widgetText">
	<div class="widgetBody pageStyles" id="div69134710-d533-4503-930a-e4812a106c24">

		<div style="min-height: 18px;">
			<div class="textContent" >The Williamson County <a target="_blank" href="https://judicialrecords.wilco.org/PublicAccess/default.aspx" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="Public Judicial Records Website Opens in new window">Public Judicial Records Website</a> contains information about all cases pending in the District Courts (except those that are restricted by law).&nbsp; This includes court assignment and court date (if set).</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.widget .textContent p:first-child {
		padding-top: 0px;
		margin-top: 0px;
	}

</style>


				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_1" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_1" role="button" aria-controls="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_1" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="1" data-tabname="File documents" contenteditable="false">File documents</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_1" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_1" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor39cb9675-a6cb-4552-bf94-8e578d95a4ba" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>The <a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/309/District-Clerk">Williamson County District Clerk</a> maintains the records of the District Courts. &nbsp;Documents are filed with that office via the statewide <a href="http://www.efiletexas.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="eFile Texas  Opens in new window" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">eFile Texas </a>system.</p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
	$(document).ready(function (e) {		
	    renderSlideshowIfApplicable($('#divEditor' + '39cb9675-a6cb-4552-bf94-8e578d95a4ba'));
	});
</script>
</div>

				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_2" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_2" role="button" aria-controls="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_2" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="2" data-tabname="Find Legal Advice" contenteditable="false">Find Legal Advice</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_2" >




<div data-widget-id="0875462a-5053-404d-883f-3cbef2a4557d" data-moduleName="list" id="widgetText0875462a-5053-404d-883f-3cbef2a4557d" class="widget widgetText">
	<div class="widgetBody pageStyles" id="div0875462a-5053-404d-883f-3cbef2a4557d">

		<div style="min-height: 18px;">
			<div class="textContent" >You should contact an attorney to assist you in resolving your matter.&nbsp; Court staff are unable to provide you with legal advice, nor can the court refer you to an attorney.&nbsp; There are several programs that provide referrals to attorneys.&nbsp; These include&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Kanit; font-size: 1em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 200;">the</span><a target="_blank" href="https://austinlrs.com/" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label=" Lawyer Referral Service of Central Texas Opens in new window" style="font-size: 1em;"> Lawyer Referral Service of Central Texas</a>,<span style="font-family: Kanit; font-size: 1em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 200;">&nbsp;the </span><a target="_blank" href="https://www.tcdla.com/" aria-label="Texas Criminal Defense Lawyers Association Opens in new window" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" style="font-size: 1em;">Texas Criminal Defense Lawyers Association</a>, and&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Kanit; font-size: 1em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 200;" class="startContainer endContainer">the <a target="_blank" href="https://www.texasbar.com/AM/Template.cfm?Section=Lawyer_Referral_Service_LRIS_&amp;Template=/CM/HTMLDisplay.cfm&amp;ContentID=60315" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Lawyer Referral and Information Service</a>&nbsp;</span><div><br>There are a number of entities who provide access to legal advice at low or no cost <strong><em>for those who qualify</em></strong>.&nbsp; <a target="_blank" href="https://texaslawhelp.org/" onkeypress="this.onclick();" onclick="return showExternalSiteDialog(this);" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="TexasLawHelp.org Opens in new window">TexasLawHelp.org</a> (the Texas Legal Services Center) and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.trla.org/" onkeypress="this.onclick();" onclick="return showExternalSiteDialog(this);" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="Texas Rio Grande Legal Aid Opens in new window">Texas Rio Grande Legal Aid</a> are two examples.</div></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.widget .textContent p:first-child {
		padding-top: 0px;
		margin-top: 0px;
	}

</style>


				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_3" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_3" role="button" aria-controls="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_3" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="3" data-tabname="I need an attorney in a felony case" contenteditable="false">I need an attorney in a felony case</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_3" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_3" >




<div data-widget-id="b8e83a74-146d-4b7d-8bec-8c19de83883b" data-moduleName="list" id="widgetTextb8e83a74-146d-4b7d-8bec-8c19de83883b" class="widget widgetText">
	<div class="widgetBody pageStyles" id="divb8e83a74-146d-4b7d-8bec-8c19de83883b">

		<div style="min-height: 18px;">
			<div class="textContent" >Most important:&nbsp; You MUST go to court, even if you can't afford an attorney.&nbsp; <br><br>The court will ask you to make a good effort to hire an attorney.&nbsp; Under certain circumstances, individuals may be eligible to have an attorney appointed to represent them in a criminal case.&nbsp; More details may be found at <a target="_blank" href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/669/Indigent-Defense" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" aria-label="Williamson County Pretrial Services Opens in new window" rel="noopener">Williamson County Pretrial Services</a> website.</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.widget .textContent p:first-child {
		padding-top: 0px;
		margin-top: 0px;
	}

</style>


				</div>
					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_4" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_4" role="button" aria-controls="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_4" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="4" data-tabname="Jury Duty information" contenteditable="false">Jury Duty information</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_4" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn359baaa5-b122-4bc3-b3a5-aceec35971b7_4" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor6b524019-72f4-4b2e-b0f3-6c7ab76efd4b" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>Information about Jury Duty can be found on the <a href="https://www.wilcotx.gov/309/District-Clerk">District Clerk&apos;s</a> website.</p>
    </div>

<script type="text/javascript">
